Version 4.0.2 is the second bug fix release of NitroHack.
Get it at http://nitrohack.org/download

Once again several bugs were fixed in the save format, making old games 
incompatible.
However, an old version of the server is running in parallel with the 
new version, so that people can finish their games.

NitroHack bugs fixed
--------------------
     Fix menu accelerators for C/#name (Alex Smith)
     Fix display for long travels when runmode != teleport (Alex Smith)
     skip over control characters and extra '\0' bytes in the log section
     fix detection by adding an explicit call to doupdate in
         curses_pause()
     binary save format fix: correctly save and restore usteed and ustuck
     make recovery from crashed game logs more robust
     binary save format fix: mon->meating was not saved
     fix writing topten entry into the finished game log
     fix: the weight of items in a carried container was not shown
     save & restore stealing state
     fix a double-free crash when attempting to load a damaged save
     fix a crash in the log replay code
     fix a crash during level creation
     fix a crash during farlook, caused by accessing deallocated objects
     fix crash while restoring games with invalid data after the log
     net client: don't hang in read() if the connection fails completely
     binary save format fix: save and restore digging state

Vanilla bugs fixed
------------------
     Fix C343-246 Engraving with an empty wand (Alex Smith, based on a
                  patch by bcd@pvv.org)
     Fix C343-129 Canceling objects in or near a shop
     Fix C343-176 Disintegration breath on monsters is not handled
                  properly
     make sure attribute bonuses are always correct
                  (found by derekt75 last Thursday)

Features
--------
     Show price of items in shops without #chatting (Patric M�ller)
     Add branch stairs as distinct from stairs and from ladders
         (Alex Smith)
     Auto-ID/Pre-ID: jumping boots, potions of oil, starting inventory
         (Alex Smith)
     Merge W/T and R/P (Alex Smith)
     Change default keybindings to AceHack-style (Alex Smith)
     Allow closing doors with o (Alex Smith)
     Show the version number on the main menu screen
     server: offer to remove saves that won't load from the list
     offer to delete damaged saves for local games
     add an "account" menu to allow changing password and email address
     reduce cursor flicker
     improved map blinking
     improve the local replay selection dialog
     during player selection, make enter default to random, not quit
     Add error recovery if the client and server state don't match
     add a default set of autopickup rules
     api/protocol change: drawing info now provides more info
     better space usage in the sidebar
     Add "unidentified items" as a new category for loot and menudrop


